      "title": "feat(ssr): support import.meta.resolve in module runner",
      "subtitle": "vitejs/vite#20260 · merged 2025-07-28 as 62835f7",
      "answer": "Server code run by Vite's module runner can now call import.meta.resolve in Node: import.meta creation moves out of ModuleRunner into a createImportMeta option, and the new createNodeImportMeta resolves through a Node customization hook. Runners that do not opt in keep throwing \"not supported\".",
